EventCode=4104 ((ScriptBlockText="*comsvcs*" AND ScriptBlockText="*MiniDump*") OR (ScriptBlockText="*procdump*" AND ScriptBlockText="*lsass*") OR ScriptBlockText="*sekurlsa*" OR ScriptBlockText="*mimikatz*" OR ScriptBlockText="*nanodump*" OR (ScriptBlockText="*lsass*" AND ScriptBlockText="*.dmp*"))
| stats count as dump_script_blocks
    values(ScriptBlockText) as script_blocks
    values(Computer) as hosts
    min(_time) as first_seen
    max(_time) as last_seen
| where dump_script_blocks > 0
| eval detection="lsass-dump-script-block", technique="T1003.001"
